  "description": "Runtime half of the MessageProtocol binary serialization library: the MessageSerializer API — registration, dispatch, generic hot paths with delegate caches, and pooled buffers — plus the message contract attributes and interfaces.\n\nStandalone it falls back to reflection; for compile-time generated serializers install the main MessageProtocol package (bundles this runtime and the source generator) or add MessageProtocol.CodeGenerator alongside.\n\nTargets netstandard2.1 (Unity-compatible) and net6.0+.",
